+     2*2^-127 in terms of relative error. Thus the relative error on R is
+     bounded by (1+e1)*(1+e2)-1 with e1=2^-122.88 and e2=2*2^-127,
+     which gives: R = y*log|x| * (1+eps1) with |eps1| < 2^-122.72 */
